  "Endast hastigheten spelar roll": "Only speed matters",
  "Vaktens position ska vara säker, inte bara synlig.": "The traffic controller's position must be safe, not merely visible.",
  "Ett arbetsfordon står rätt men dess varningslykta har slutat fungera under pågående arbete. Vad bör ske?": "A work vehicle is correctly positioned, but its warning beacon stops working during the work. What should happen?",
